<<link [[起床|FS Morans Home Flat]]>><</link>>

:: FS Morans Home Kitchen
<<set _link to true>>
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">>
厨房很小，灶台上坐着一口锅，抽油烟机嗡嗡地响。苏梦棠背对着门在切东西。
<br><br>
<<set _h to $fs_morKitchen>>
<<if _h>>
	<span class="gold"><<print _h>></span>
	<br><br>
