:: FS Morans Home Eat
<<set _link to true>>
<<run finalStar.morPass(30)>>
<<run finalStar.morHomeEat()>>
你盛了一碗，坐在厨房的小桌边吃完。锅里的东西很烫，吃到一半额头就出了汗。
<br><br>
<<print finalStar.statHint("饥饿", 1, "green")>>
<br><br>
