/* ================= 结局 E：无声的第十天 ================= */

:: FS Console Endings
<<set _link to true>>
【结局预览】直接写入对应结局（会改存档状态，测完可用「重置」清掉）
<br><br>
<<link "A · 兵将疾行">><<run finalStar.morEnd('a')>><<run finalStar.morExit()>><<goto "FS Morans Wake Up">><</link>>
<br>
<<link "B · 爱">><<run finalStar.morEndB()>><<run finalStar.morExit()>><<goto "FS Morans Wake Up">><</link>>
<br>
<<link "C · 崩坏（玖肆死亡）">><<run finalStar.morEndC()>><<run finalStar.morExit()>><<goto "FS Morans Wake Up">><</link>>
<br>
<<link "D · 留影">><<run finalStar.morEnd('d')>><<run finalStar.morExit()>><<goto "FS Morans Wake Up">><</link>>
